SKIP:
   =================
   {P} skip {P}

ASSIGNMENT:
   ==========================
   {Q[E/x]} x := E {Q}

   (Substitute E for x in Q to get the precondition)

SEQUENTIAL:
   {P} C1 {R}    {R} C2 {Q}
   =========================
      {P} C1; C2 {Q}

CONDITIONAL:
   {P land B} C1 {Q}    {P land neg B} C2 {Q}
   =============================================
   {P} if B then C1 else C2 {Q}

WHILE (partial correctness):
   {I land B} C {I}
   ==============================
   {I} while B do C {I land neg B}

   I = loop invariant

CONSEQUENCE:
   P' => P    {P} C {Q}    Q => Q'
   ==================================
            {P'} C {Q'}
